Function:
  + (total-cost) :total-cost
  - (total-fuel-used)
Action:
  - fly-fast: ?a - aircraft ?c1 - city ?c2 - city
      pre: (and (<= (onboard ?a) (zoom-limit ?a)) (>= (fuel ?a) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (fast-burn ?a))) (located ?a ?c1))
      eff: (and (decrease (fuel ?a) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (fast-burn ?a))) (increase (total-fuel-used) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (fast-burn ?a))) (located ?a ?c2) (not (located ?a ?c1)))
  + fly-fast: ?a - aircraft ?c1 - city ?c2 - city
      pre: (and (<= (onboard ?a) (zoom-limit ?a)) (>= (fuel ?a) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (fast-burn ?a))) (located ?a ?c1))
      eff: (and (decrease (fuel ?a) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (fast-burn ?a))) (increase (total-cost) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (fast-burn ?a))) (located ?a ?c2) (not (located ?a ?c1)))
  - fly-slow: ?a - aircraft ?c1 - city ?c2 - city
      pre: (and (>= (fuel ?a) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (slow-burn ?a))) (located ?a ?c1))
      eff: (and (decrease (fuel ?a) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (slow-burn ?a))) (increase (total-fuel-used) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (slow-burn ?a))) (located ?a ?c2) (not (located ?a ?c1)))
  + fly-slow: ?a - aircraft ?c1 - city ?c2 - city
      pre: (and (>= (fuel ?a) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (slow-burn ?a))) (located ?a ?c1))
      eff: (and (decrease (fuel ?a) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (slow-burn ?a))) (increase (total-cost) (* (distance ?c1 ?c2) (slow-burn ?a))) (located ?a ?c2) (not (located ?a ?c1)))
Init:
  - (= (total-fuel-used) 0)
  + (= (total-cost) 0)
Metric:
  + (total-cost)
  - (total-fuel-used)
Func prop:
  + (total-cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff rhs_funcs:(distance fast-burn slow-burn) write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
  - (total-fuel-used): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff rhs_funcs:(distance fast-burn slow-burn) write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
Global prop:
  + action_cost_func:(total-cost)
  - action_cost_func:(total-fuel-used)
